From 8e8ccacae75192b06ea3287783feb28db4f4a6f2 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: SP11 Linux Project <272055834+geocausa@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Tue, 27 Oct 2026 21:54:48 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 08/47] ASoC: qcom: port SP11 protected AudioReach graph
 support

Port the accepted SP11 protected AudioReach graph plumbing from the
Golden-v31 source snapshot onto Linux v7.3. Reuse v7.3 generic push/pull
support where it supersedes the older private implementation.

This provides the protected calibration, VI/CPS graph and low-level SP11
parameter interfaces used by the later lifecycle and control commits.

Signed-off-by: SP11 Linux Project <272055834+geocausa@users.noreply.github.com>
